      {
        "h_title": "Thai Fried Mussels Recipe (Hoi Tod)",
        "main_title": "Thai Fried Mussels Recipe (Hoi Tod)",
        "author": "Praew",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "This Thai fried mussels recipe with egg, or hoi tod, brings together juicy seafood and fresh bean sprouts in a crispy omelette. It’s ideal for a quick meal or light side dish, easy to make, and full of flavor!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "This Asian mussels recipe is the latest in my collection of seafood recipes, and it’s got my grandmother’s seal of approval! She’s the biggest seafood fan in our family, and this dish, along with pad ped talay, are some of her favorites.",
            "url": "https://hungryinthailand.com/category/thai-seafood-recipes/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://hungryinthailand.com/category/thai-seafood-recipes/",
